				Comp. of
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγαθός</span>, <i>better, more
			excellent</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> only in neut., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βέλτερόν
			[ἐστι</span>] <i>it is better</i>, c. inf., <i><span class="en">
