				Thgn.
				92
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Th.</u>
				337
			</span></i>, etc.: 
				Sup.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βέλτατος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Eu.</u>
				487
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Supp.</u>
				1054
			</span></i>.</div>
